    "updated_at": "2020-12-10T18:12:19Z",
    "body": "@andytom [spacefish](https://github.com/matchai/spacefish) checks for the existence of `.js` files [here](https://github.com/matchai/spacefish/blob/95b8fc92f1d667db9cede28d4f91f890d47eb21b/functions/__sf_section_node.fish#L26) and `.rb` files [here](https://github.com/matchai/spacefish/blob/95b8fc92f1d667db9cede28d4f91f890d47eb21b/functions/__sf_section_ruby.fish#L25).\r\n\r\n```fish\r\n# Show versions only for Node-specific folders\r\nif not test -f ./package.json \\\r\n  -o -d ./node_modules \\\r\n  -o (count *.js) -gt 0\r\n  return\r\nend\r\n```\r\n```fish\r\n# Show versions only for Ruby-specific folders\r\nif not test -f Gemfile \\\r\n  -o -f Rakefile \\\r\n  -o (count *.rb) -gt 0\r\n  return\r\nend\r\n```",
